<section class="case-gallery-section"><div class="case-gallery-heading"><p>IN PRACTICE</p><h2>Review before sending</h2><span>The proposal and message stay together while the team checks the final details.</span></div><div class="case-gallery"><figure class="case-gallery__item"><div class="case-gallery__frame"><img src="../../../assets/evidence/proposta-revisao-sanitizada.webp" alt="Proposal details prepared for a final review." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><figcaption><span class="evidence-label">REVIEW</span><strong>Check the document before it leaves the team.</strong></figcaption></figure><figure class="case-gallery__item"><div class="case-gallery__frame"><img src="../../../assets/evidence/proposta-envio-sanitizada.webp" alt="Email and attached proposal ready for a human check." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><figcaption><span class="evidence-label">APPROVAL</span><strong>The external send stays under human control.</strong></figcaption></figure></div></section>
